iphonebridge (0.16.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Emoji picker in the composer: search, a recently-used tab, and the
    full system emoji set, read from the desktop's emoji dictionary.
  * Emoji in messages are drawn larger than the words, and an
    emoji-only message is drawn large and bubble-less.
  * Fixed uneven, bold-looking text on fractional-scale displays by
    rendering all text with curve rendering.
  * The conversation and the emoji picker are a little larger.

 -- santisbon <santisbon@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 28 Aug 2026 14:01:37 -0500

